# ACC-FG-HON-01 · Honey Tobacco v1.0

A dark honey-tobacco base using PADMA, phenethyl alcohol, immortelle, damascenone, dry tobacco, coumarin, benzoin and warm woods.

**Category:** Fruit & Gourmand  
**Recommended use:** 0.5–6% of perfume concentrate  
**Maturation:** 14–21 days  
**Monte Carlo pass:** 97.12%  
**Design score:** 100.00/100  
**Outcome:** `COMPUTATIONAL ACCORD DESIGN PASS`

